#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md
msgid "graphql, yoga, resolver, schema, rescript, hono, drizzle, graphiql"
msgstr "graphql, yoga, リゾルバ, スキーマ, rescript, hono, drizzle, graphiql"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md:7
msgid "Add a GraphQL Resolver"
msgstr "GraphQL リゾルバの追加"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md:9
msgid ""
"The Hono + GraphQL template ships `graphql-yoga` mounted on Hono at "
"`/graphql`. It includes GraphiQL (at the same URL) and a users type "
"backed by Drizzle/SQLite. This recipe extends it with a `posts` type."
msgstr ""
"Hono + GraphQL テンプレートは `graphql-yoga` を Hono の `/graphql` に"
"マウントして同梱します。同じ URL に GraphiQL が含まれ、Drizzle/SQLite"
" を背後に持つ users 型が用意されています。このレシピでは `posts` 型を"
"追加して拡張します。"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md:11
msgid "Generated Layout"
msgstr "生成されるレイアウト"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md:13
msgid "`src/schema.graphql` — human-authored SDL (mirrored in typeDefs)"
msgstr "`src/schema.graphql` — 人間が編集する SDL (typeDefs にミラー)"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md:14
msgid ""
"`src/GraphqlSchema.res` — inlined `typeDefs` + `rootValue` consumed by "
"yoga"
msgstr ""
"`src/GraphqlSchema.res` — yoga が消費するインライン化された `typeDefs`"
" と `rootValue`"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md:15
msgid "`src/Resolvers/Users.res` — existing users query/mutation resolvers"
msgstr "`src/Resolvers/Users.res` — 既存の users クエリ/ミューテーションリゾルバ"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md:16
msgid "`src/Schema.res` — Drizzle users table"
msgstr "`src/Schema.res` — Drizzle の users テーブル"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-graphql-resolver.md:17
msgid "`src/Server.res` — Hono app mounting yoga"
msgstr "`src/Server.res` — yoga をマウントする Hono アプリ"

